1. The Problem
Imagine your Spring Boot application is hosted in:
Mumbai (India)
43.10.10.1
https://myapp.com/logo.png
Distance is small.
Response:
40 ms
Good.
_______________________________________
Now a user from
New York
requests same image.
Request path:
New York
↓
Atlantic Ocean
↓
Europe
↓
Middle East
↓
India
Response:
350 ms
Much slower.
________________________________________
And another issue:
Every user is downloading:
logo.png
from same server.
100 users
1000 users
100000 users
10000000 users
Your origin server becomes overloaded.
________________________________________
Fundamental Problem
Three major issues:
Latency
Users far away = slow response.
Bandwidth
Origin server sends same file millions of times.
Availability
Origin failure means everyone fails.
