3. CDN Idea
Instead of one server:
Origin
|
Mumbai
Create copies.
Origin
Mumbai
    /               |              \
Tokyo   London   NewYork
Now users fetch from nearest copy.
________________________________________
This copy is called:
Edge Cache
________________________________________
Core Definition
A CDN (Content Delivery Network) is:
A globally distributed network that stores cached content closer to end users.

