5. Request Flow (Very Important)
Let's follow:
GET /logo.png
________________________________________
First Request
User:
Hyderabad
requests:
/logo.png
________________________________________
Step 1
Request reaches nearest CDN edge.
User
|
Mumbai Edge
_______________________________________
Step 2
Cache lookup.
logo.png ?
Not found.
Cache Miss.
________________________________________
Step 3
Edge requests origin.
Edge
|
Origin
________________________________________
