6. Internal Data Structures
At the edge server:
Most CDN systems maintain structures similar to:
Java
Map<String, CachedObject>
Example:  cache.put( "/logo.png", image);
________________________________________
Each object stores:
class CachedObject { 
byte[] data;
long expiryTime;
Map<String,String> headers;
}
