7. Cache Hit vs Cache Miss
Critical KPI.
________________________________________
Cache Hit
User
|
Edge Cache
|
Response
Latency: 5 ms
________________________________________
Cache Miss
User
|
Edge
|
Origin
|
Edge
|
User
Latency: 200 ms
________________________________________
Formula:
Hit Ratio = Hits / Total Requests
________________________________________
Example:
95 hits
5 misses
Hit Ratio: 95%
Excellent CDN performance.
