8. Why CDNs Are Extremely Fast
Several reasons.
________________________________________
Reason 1
Geographic proximity
User -> Nearby Edge
instead of
User -> Origin
________________________________________
Reason 2
Persistent connections.
CDNs maintain long-lived connections to origin.
Avoid repeated TCP handshakes.
________________________________________
Reason 3
Memory-based caching.
Many hot objects live in RAM.
Lookup speed: Microseconds
