10. Failure Cases
Real systems fail.
________________________________________
Scenario 1
Edge Server Down
Mumbai Edge ❌
What happens?
Traffic rerouted.
Hyderabad
↓
Bangalore Edge
Latency increases but service works.
________________________________________
Scenario 2
Origin Down
Edge still serves:
cached content
until expiry.
This is why CDNs improve availability.
________________________________________
Scenario 3
Cache Full
Need eviction.
Common algorithms:
LRU
LFU
FIFO
We'll study cache internals later.
________________________________________
Scenario 4
Network Partition
Edge cannot reach origin.
Serve:
stale content
temporarily.
Production CDNs do this often.
