7. Failure Scenarios
This is where senior engineers think differently.
________________________________________
Scenario 1: Edge Server Crash
Edge5 ❌
Load balancer removes it.
Traffic shifts.
________________________________________
Scenario 2: Whole PoP Down
Mumbai PoP ❌
What happens?
Anycast announcement disappears.
BGP recalculates.
Traffic automatically reroutes.
Example:
Hyderabad
↓
Bangalore
Or
Singapore
________________________________________
Scenario 3: ISP Failure
Suppose:
Jio ↔ Mumbai link broken

BGP finds alternative route.
Users still reach CDN.
________________________________________
Scenario 4: Traffic Spike
10K RPS
↓
500K RPS
PoP overloaded.
CDN may:
Redirect Traffic
Use Neighboring PoPs
Apply Rate Limits
________________________________________
Performance Analysis
________________________________________
DNS Lookup
Typically: 5-50 ms and cached by browser.
________________________________________
Anycast Routing
Cost: Almost zero, handled by Internet routing.
________________________________________
PoP Load Balancing
Round Robin: O(1)
________________________________________
Least Connections: O(log N) using priority queues.
________________________________________
Cache Lookup: O(1) average HashMap lookup.
